@startuml
title Storage Route Resolution - Typed Keys
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox

actor Caller
participant DefaultStorageRouteResolver as Resolver
participant HashShardResolver as Shard
participant RouteMappingStrategy as Mapping

Caller -> Caller : build ShardValue / ShardKey\nand CompositeShardKey / RouteContext
Caller -> Resolver : resolve(context)
Resolver -> Resolver : context.requireShardKey()
Resolver -> Shard : resolve(CompositeShardKey)
alt one field
  Shard -> Shard : hash stable value text\n(preserve old single-field assignments)
else multiple fields
  Shard -> Shard : hash v1 canonical encoding\n(names, types, values and order)
end
Shard -> Shard : floorMod and derive indexes
Shard --> Resolver : ShardRouteInfo
Resolver -> Mapping : map(shardInfo)
Mapping --> Resolver : PhysicalStorageLocation
Resolver -> Resolver : StorageRoute.builder().context(context)\n.shardInfo(shardInfo).location(location).build()
Resolver --> Caller : StorageRoute

note over Resolver, Mapping
Missing keys and missing results fail immediately.
Context metadata does not enter shard calculation.
No JDBC execution or transaction begins here.
end note
@enduml
